family Supply Diffuser
category air_terminal
host ceiling
ifc IfcAirTerminal DIFFUSER
param Size length type 600mm
param NeckD length type 250mm
param NeckH length type 200mm
param Face length type 30mm
param Flow number type 300
param Finish material type "Steel White"
type "600x600" Size=600mm, NeckD=250mm, Flow=400
type "300x300" Size=300mm, NeckD=160mm, Flow=150
type "24x24 in" Size=610mm, NeckD=250mm, Flow=400
extrude Plate rect(-Size / 2, -Size / 2, Size / 2, Size / 2) z(-Face, 0mm) mat(Finish) show(3d, elev)
revolve Neck rect(0, 0mm, NeckD / 2, NeckH) mat(Finish) show(3d, elev)
symbol rect(-Size / 2, -Size / 2, Size / 2, Size / 2)
symbol line(-Size / 2, -Size / 2, Size / 2, Size / 2) show(medium, fine)
symbol line(-Size / 2, Size / 2, Size / 2, -Size / 2) show(medium, fine)
connector Air duct at(0, 0, NeckH) dir(0, 0, 1) size(NeckD)
